    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Thanks to the generosity of the members of the NAC Orchestra and of additional organizations and individuals, laureates will be chosen from the semi-finals to compete in the Finals for the following prizes:\n\nThe NAC Orchestra Bursary,\n\nThe Crabtree Foundation Award,\n\nThe Friends of the NAC Orchestra Award,\n\nThe NAC Orchestra Vic Pomer Award,\n\nThe Dorothy M. Horwood Award,\n\nThe Friends of the NAC Orchestra Evelyn Greenberg Award,\n\nThe Piccolo Prix, and\n\nThe Sturdevant Prize for Orchestral Excerpts \n\nThe first NAC Orchestra Bursary Competition was in 1981. The Bursary provides recognition and..."
      }
